WEBVTT

00:06:30.803 --> 00:06:33.336
I've never lived
as Daniel Lismore, the person.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.454
I've lived as Daniel Lismore, the artwork.

00:06:36.174 --> 00:06:38.761
And I've faced every
obstacle as an artwork.

00:06:40.402 --> 00:06:42.294
It can be hard ...

00:06:42.318 --> 00:06:46.459
especially if your wardrobe
takes up a 40-foot container,

00:06:46.483 --> 00:06:49.397
three storage units
and 30 boxes from IKEA --

00:06:49.421 --> 00:06:50.936
(Laughter)

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:54.968
and sometimes, it can be
very difficult, getting into cars,

00:06:54.992 --> 00:06:56.218
and sometimes --

00:06:56.242 --> 00:06:58.910
well, this morning I didn't fit
through my bathroom door,

00:06:58.934 --> 00:07:00.177
so that was a problem.